@AbpDynamicProxy_Demo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5183

### 1) 无权限 → 403（缺 Demo.Users）
GET {{AbpDynamicProxy_Demo_HostAddress}}/api/users

### 2) 仅 Default → 列表 200
GET {{AbpDynamicProxy_Demo_HostAddress}}/api/users
X-Permissions: Demo.Users

### 3) 仅 Default 创建 → 403（缺 Demo.Users.Create）
POST {{AbpDynamicProxy_Demo_HostAddress}}/api/users?userName=bob
X-Permissions: Demo.Users

### 4) Default + Create → 创建 200
POST {{AbpDynamicProxy_Demo_HostAddress}}/api/users?userName=bob
X-Permissions: Demo.Users,Demo.Users.Create

### 5) Default + Delete → 删除 200
DELETE {{AbpDynamicProxy_Demo_HostAddress}}/api/users/bob
X-Permissions: Demo.Users,Demo.Users.Delete

### 6) 查看 DI 解析的是否是代理
GET {{AbpDynamicProxy_Demo_HostAddress}}/api/users/proxy-info
